sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Qualification as Qualification
    participant EventBus
    Client->>+Qualification: revoke(notes)
    Note over Qualification: Policies: qualificationRead, qualificationWrite, qualificationExecute
    Note over Qualification: Guards (4)
    Qualification->>Qualification: guard[0]: self.status == #quot;active#quot;
    Qualification->>Qualification: guard[1]: self.grantedAt != null
    Qualification->>Qualification: guard[2]: self.deletedAt == null
    Qualification->>Qualification: guard[3]: roleAllows(user.role, #quot;workforceManageAccess#quot;)
    Qualification->>Qualification: compute.previousStatus
    Qualification->>Qualification: mutate.status
    Qualification->>Qualification: mutate.revokedAt
    Qualification->>Qualification: mutate.notes
    Qualification->>EventBus: emit QualificationRevoked on qualification.revoked
    Qualification-->>-Client: void